AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_NightArrival::
	.string "VILA AMANHECER, after dark.\p"
	.string "Rain taps DONA ZILA's roof.\n"
	.string "Three rescued creatures watch\n"
	.string "you from beside the stove.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_NightZila::
	.string "DONA ZILA: A strange roof feels\n"
	.string "less strange once you learn who\n"
	.string "shares it.\p"
	.string "Speak with ANAHI. Then sit with\n"
	.string "each of our guests.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_NightAnahi::
	.string "PROF. ANAHI: I found the three\n"
	.string "near land claimed by the\n"
	.string "CONSORTIUM.\p"
	.string "They stayed when I approached.\p"
	.string "Tonight they need quiet.\n"
	.string "They do not need a TRAINER.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_NightPimpau::
	.string "PIMPAU keeps one old seed\n"
	.string "pressed against its chest.\p"
	.string "Its kind marks every fallen tree\n"
	.string "so the forest can remember.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_NightCaramelo::
	.string "CARAMELO lies facing the front\n"
	.string "door.\p"
	.string "It guards the homes of people\n"
	.string "who have lost one before.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_NightQuero::
	.string "QUERO calls once toward a nest\n"
	.string "that is no longer there.\p"
	.string "Its ancestors warned sleeping\n"
	.string "villages before the floods.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_NightReady::
	.string "Everyone is settled.\p"
	.string "DONA ZILA lowers the lamp. The\n"
	.string "rain becomes the only voice in\n"
	.string "the room.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_BlockExitNight::
	.string "Rain covers the village road.\p"
	.string "DONA ZILA asked you to meet\n"
	.string "everyone under this roof before\n"
	.string "sleeping.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_NightWatch::
	.string "Something enormous crosses the\n"
	.string "alley beyond the curtains.\p"
	.string "Its outline is gray, as if the\n"
	.string "night forgot its color.\p"
	.string "All three creatures stand\n"
	.string "between the window and the\n"
	.string "house.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_Dawn::
	.string "Morning light reaches the stove.\p"
	.string "DONA ZILA places three bowls\n"
	.string "on the floor.\p"
	.string "Feed all three before choosing\n"
	.string "who will travel with you.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_ZilaCareReminder::
	.string "DONA ZILA: Nobody chooses on\n"
	.string "an empty stomach.\p"
	.string "Care for all three first.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_ZilaBlessing::
	.string "DONA ZILA: Take my notebook.\n"
	.string "Bring every story home.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_AnahiBeforeChoice::
	.string "PROF. ANAHI: Each one lost a\n"
	.string "home to the CONSORTIUM.\p"
	.string "Feed all three. Then sit beside\n"
	.string "the one you understand.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_AnahiAfterChoice::
	.string "PROF. ANAHI: Your field pages\n"
	.string "are ready in ZILA's notebook.\p"
	.string "The CENSUS begins outside.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_FeedPimpau::
	.string "You fill PIMPAU's bowl.\p"
	.string "It keeps one old seed tucked\n"
	.string "close to its chest.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_FeedCaramelo::
	.string "You fill CARAMELO's bowl.\p"
	.string "It eats facing the front door,\n"
	.string "still guarding the house.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_FeedQuero::
	.string "You fill QUERO's bowl.\p"
	.string "It calls once toward a nest\n"
	.string "that is no longer there.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_AllFed::
	.string "All three bowls are full.\p"
	.string "Now sit beside the partner\n"
	.string "you want to keep.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_PimpauStory::
	.string "PIMPAU marks every fallen tree\n"
	.string "so the forest can remember.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_PimpauPrompt::
	.string "Sit beside PIMPAU and keep it?$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_CarameloStory::
	.string "CARAMELO guards the doors of\n"
	.string "those who have lost a home.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_CarameloPrompt::
	.string "Sit beside CARAMELO and\n"
	.string "keep it?$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_QueroStory::
	.string "QUERO once cried all night so\n"
	.string "a sleeping village could flee.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_QueroPrompt::
	.string "Sit beside QUERO and keep it?$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_ZilaChosen::
	.string "DONA ZILA: That one chose you\n"
	.string "last night.\p"
	.string "You just took longer to notice.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_NotebookReceived::
	.string "DONA ZILA'S NOTEBOOK was placed\n"
	.string "in the KEY ITEMS pocket.\p"
	.string "Open it whenever you need the\n"
	.string "current objective or records.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_NotebookBagFull::
	.string "The KEY ITEMS pocket is full.\p"
	.string "Make room, then speak with\n"
	.string "DONA ZILA to recover the book.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_CensusInvitation::
	.string "PROF. ANAHI adds field pages\n"
	.string "to DONA ZILA's notebook.\p"
	.string "Your partner is registered.\n"
	.string "The CENSUS OF LEGENDS begins.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_BlockExit::
	.string "DONA ZILA: Three bowls first.\p"
	.string "Nobody leaves this house\n"
	.string "uncared for.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_FeedAllFirst::
	.string "It waits by the bowl.\p"
	.string "Feed all three before choosing.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_AlreadyChosen::
	.string "Your partner stays close.\p"
	.string "The other two will travel with\n"
	.string "CIRO and PROF. ANAHI.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_ChoiceCancelled::
	.string "You stand again.\n"
	.string "You may sit beside another.$"

AraunaResearchCenter_Text_BeforeCall::
	.string "PROF. ANAHI: The three are at\n"
	.string "DONA ZILA's house.\p"
	.string "Return home. Care comes before\n"
	.string "the CENSUS.$"

AraunaResearchCenter_Text_MaiaIntroduction::
	.string "The field annex is ready.\p"
	.string "Your choice still belongs at\n"
	.string "DONA ZILA's house.$"

AraunaResearchCenter_Text_AfterChoice::
	.string "Your party was restored.\p"
	.string "CIRO is waiting in the plaza.\p"
	.string "He will test your preparation\n"
	.string "before opening the route.$"

AraunaResearchCenter_Text_RouteOpen::
	.string "Your party was restored.\p"
	.string "The east path is open.\p"
	.string "Record everything the mist\n"
	.string "tries to hide.$"

AraunaResearchCenter_Text_PicaPauPrompt::
	.string "PIMPAU No. 007: GRASS.\p"
	.string "Uses wood and stone to\n"
	.string "control the terrain.\p"
	.string "Choose it as your partner?$"

AraunaResearchCenter_Text_CarameloPrompt::
	.string "CARAMELO No. 001: FIRE.\p"
	.string "A protective dog that will\n"
	.string "one day reach FIRE/DRAGON.\p"
	.string "Choose it as your partner?$"

AraunaResearchCenter_Text_QueroQueroPrompt::
	.string "QUERO No. 004: WATER.\p"
	.string "Fast and territorial; it will\n"
	.string "one day reach WATER/BUG.\p"
	.string "Choose it as your partner?$"

AraunaResearchCenter_Text_DexLinkNotice::
	.string "Partner registered.\p"
	.string "Its data and artwork are linked\n"
	.string "to its numbered ARAUNA DEX\n"
	.string "entry.$"
AraunaResearchCenter_Text_DexActivated::
	.string "PROF. ANAHI: The ARAUNA DEX\n"
	.string "is now active.\p"
	.string "All 386 native species can now\n"
	.string "be recorded by their own number.\p"
	.string "Observe their habitats and help\n"
	.string "us complete every entry.$"

AraunaResearchCenter_Text_SelectionLocked::
	.string "Choose at DONA ZILA's house,\n"
	.string "after feeding all three.$"

AraunaResearchCenter_Text_AlreadyChosen::
	.string "These stations track the two\n"
	.string "partners traveling with CIRO\n"
	.string "and PROF. ANAHI.$"

AraunaResearchCenter_Text_ChoiceCancelled::
	.string "The sphere becomes still.\n"
	.string "You can keep observing.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_ObjectiveHome::
	.string "DONA ZILA's home is northwest.\n"
	.string "The prologue begins inside.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_ObjectiveCenter::
	.string "Return to DONA ZILA's house.\n"
	.string "Care for all three partners.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_ObjectiveCiro::
	.string "CIRO is waiting in the plaza.\p"
	.string "Speak with him before using the\n"
	.string "east path.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_ObjectiveRoute::
	.string "Explore the MIST ROUTE through\n"
	.string "the east path.\p"
	.string "Return with a field note and a\n"
	.string "new agreement.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_RouteLocked::
	.string "CIRO asked to speak before you\n"
	.string "take the east path.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_ObjectiveCiroBattle::
	.string "The mist left a gray trail.\p"
	.string "CIRO is waiting in the plaza to\n"
	.string "hear what you found.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_ObjectiveSliceComplete::
	.string "PORTO DAS REDES sent word.\p"
	.string "The tide has gone pale and the\n"
	.string "fishers have fallen silent.\p"
	.string "Follow the east path and cross\n"
	.string "the coast road on foot.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_CiroBeforeRoute::
	.string "CIRO: ANAHI wants field notes,\n"
	.string "not a race.\p"
	.string "Take the FIELD KIT. Meet\n"
	.string "something beyond your first\n"
	.string "partner.\p"
	.string "When the mist gives you a reason\n"
	.string "to turn back, find me here.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_CiroWaiting::
	.string "CIRO: Do not rush the mist.\p"
	.string "Return when ZILA's notebook has\n"
	.string "something neither of us can\n"
	.string "explain.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_CiroDeparture::
	.string "CIRO: This came from the\n"
	.string "CONSORTIUM.\p"
	.string "A field scholarship, meals, and\n"
	.string "medicine for home.\p"
	.string "I know what they take. I also\n"
	.string "know what illness costs.\p"
	.string "They called me to PORTO. I leave\n"
	.string "by the coast road.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_PortoLead::
	.string "A call reaches CIRO from\n"
	.string "PORTO DAS REDES.\p"
	.string "The tide has gone pale, and the\n"
	.string "fishers have fallen silent.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_CiroAfterPrologue::
	.string "CIRO: The coast road is open.\p"
	.string "No shortcut this time. We cross\n"
	.string "the mist and shoreline on foot.$"

@ The three founding stories of Dona Zila (canonical script v2.0, P08).
@ Reused verbatim by the post-game radio quest; do not paraphrase.

AraunaZilaStory_Text_Pimpau::
	.	string "High on the range there was an\n"
	.string "araucaria so old that nobody\l"
	.string "remembered it small.\p"
	.string "When they felled the tree, they\n"
	.string "said it was only timber.\p"
	.string "Then they felled another.\n"
	.string "And another.\p"
	.string "A PIMPAU watched it all.\p"
	.string "For each trunk that fell, it\n"
	.string "pecked a stone.\p"
	.string "One stroke for the imbuia.\n"
	.string "Two for the cinnamon tree.\l"
	.string "Three for the pine that shaded\l"
	.string "the spring.\p"
	.string "The axe worked fast.\n"
	.string "The beak worked slowly.\p"
	.string "They laughed at it. They said\n"
	.string "stone does not become tree and\l"
	.string "a name bears no fruit.\p"
	.string "When the rain came, it washed\n"
	.string "loose earth over the stumps.\p"
	.string "Those who came back to plant\n"
	.string "no longer knew what had stood\l"
	.string "in each place.\p"
	.string "The PIMPAU led the people to\n"
	.string "the stone. It struck once,\l"
	.string "twice, three times.\p"
	.string "Owner by owner, name by name,\n"
	.string "the shape of the forest came\l"
	.string "back.\p"
	.string "They planted again.\n"
	.string "It did not grow back the same.\l"
	.string "What is lost never does.\p"
	.string "But a forest grew that knew\n"
	.string "whom it descended from.\p"
	.string "That is why the PIMPAU keeps a\n"
	.string "seed, and carves names where\l"
	.string "time cannot reach them easily.\p"
	.string "Remembering does not bring the\n"
	.string "tree back.\p"
	.string "It stops anyone from looking\n"
	.string "at the emptiness and saying\l"
	.string "no forest was ever there.$"

AraunaZilaStory_Text_Caramelo::
	.	string "They say that before Vila\n"
	.string "Amanhecer had a name, a heavy\l"
	.string "rain fell for seven nights.\p"
	.string "On the first, a clay-coloured\n"
	.string "dog knocked at the big house.\p"
	.string "They sent it away. They said\n"
	.string "it dirtied the floor.\p"
	.string "On the second, it knocked at\n"
	.string "the store. They sent it away.\l"
	.string "They said it scared off\l"
	.string "customers.\p"
	.string "On the third, it knocked at\n"
	.string "the chapel. They sent it away.\l"
	.string "They said an animal could not\l"
	.string "understand a promise.\p"
	.string "So it went to the edge of the\n"
	.string "land, where the families lived\l"
	.string "who had no wall, no deed, no\l"
	.string "street on the map.\p"
	.string "There nobody had a door to\n"
	.string "open.\p"
	.string "The dog lay down where a door\n"
	.string "should have been.\p"
	.string "When the water rose, it was\n"
	.string "the one that barked.\p"
	.string "When the bank gave way, it was\n"
	.string "the one that bit the children's\l"
	.string "clothes and pulled them out\l"
	.string "one by one.\p"
	.string "When the cold came, it lay\n"
	.string "over the feet of whoever was\l"
	.string "shivering.\p"
	.string "By morning the big house was\n"
	.string "empty. The store was empty.\l"
	.string "The chapel was empty.\p"
	.string "But at the edge of the land\n"
	.string "there were living people\l"
	.string "around a dog covered in mud.\p"
	.string "That is where they raised the\n"
	.string "first doorstep of Vila\l"
	.string "Amanhecer.\p"
	.string "That is why the CARAMELO\n"
	.string "guards the door of those who\l"
	.string "have no door.\p"
	.string "Not because the house is his.\p"
	.string "Because nobody should face the\n"
	.string "night without knowing where\l"
	.string "the world ends and a safe\l"
	.string "place begins.$"

AraunaZilaStory_Text_Quero::
	.	string "Before the river had a gauge\n"
	.string "and a siren, the one who warned\l"
	.string "of the flood was a QUERO.\p"
	.string "It nested in the lowest field\n"
	.string "in the village.\p"
	.string "Everyone said it was a bad\n"
	.string "spot.\p"
	.string "It screamed whenever anyone\n"
	.string "came near, and people laughed\l"
	.string "at that little bird picking a\l"
	.string "fight with the size of the\l"
	.string "world.\p"
	.string "On a moonless night, the river\n"
	.string "left its bank without a sound.\p"
	.string "The QUERO felt the water touch\n"
	.string "the eggs, and screamed.\p"
	.string "Nobody got up.\p"
	.string "It screamed again.\n"
	.string "One window lit.\p"
	.string "It screamed until its chest\n"
	.string "hurt. Another window lit.\l"
	.string "Then another.\p"
	.string "By the time they felt water\n"
	.string "running under the beds, the\l"
	.string "whole village was awake.\p"
	.string "The people climbed to high\n"
	.string "ground carrying children,\l"
	.string "pots, portraits and whatever\l"
	.string "else fit in their arms.\p"
	.string "When the sun came up, the\n"
	.string "houses were still there.\p"
	.string "The nest was not.\p"
	.string "They searched for the eggs for\n"
	.string "days.\p"
	.string "The QUERO let nobody near the\n"
	.string "empty field. It went on\l"
	.string "defending the place where the\l"
	.string "nest had been.\p"
	.string "They say it was stubbornness.\p"
	.string "I say it was memory.\p"
	.string "That is why the QUERO screams\n"
	.string "before the water comes.\p"
	.string "Courage is not losing nothing.\p"
	.string "Sometimes it is losing what\n"
	.string "was yours and waking the\l"
	.string "others anyway.$"

@ P12 (CIRO's badge) and P13 (the departure promise): the prologue Bond choices.

AraunaMapLab_Text_CiroBadgeReveal::
	.string "CIRO turns, and a lanyard\n"
	.string "slips out from his collar.\p"
	.string "A CONSORTIUM badge.\p"
	.string "CIRO: Don't look at me like\n"
	.string "that.\p"
	.string "Full scholarship. A health\n"
	.string "plan for my mother.\p"
	.string "Your grandmother keeps\n"
	.string "stories.\p"
	.string "Mine keeps a prescription she\n"
	.string "cannot pay for.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_CiroBadgeAskMother::
	.string "Ask how his mother is doing?$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_CiroBadgeAskMotherReply::
	.string "CIRO stops. The rehearsed\n"
	.string "answer does not come.\p"
	.string "CIRO: ...Some days she gets up.\p"
	.string "Thanks for asking her name\n"
	.string "before mine.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_CiroBadgeCriticize::
	.string "Tell him what the CONSORTIUM\n"
	.string "really buys?$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_CiroBadgeCriticizeReply::
	.string "CIRO: You think I don't know\n"
	.string "what they are?\p"
	.string "I know exactly. I signed\n"
	.string "anyway.\p"
	.string "CIRO: Say it again when you\n"
	.string "have something better to\l"
	.string "offer her.$"

AraunaMapLab_Text_CiroBadgeSilentReply::
	.string "You say nothing.\p"
	.string "CIRO waits for the argument.\n"
	.string "It does not come.\p"
	.string "CIRO: ...Right. Of course.\p"
	.string "That is worse, you know.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_ZilaDepartureBlessing::
	.string "DONA ZILA: Then it is time.\p"
	.string "I am not going to hand you a\n"
	.string "mission. Missions get dropped.\p"
	.string "Hand me a promise instead.\n"
	.string "Promises get carried.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_PromiseReturn::
	.string "Promise that you will come\n"
	.string "back?$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_PromiseReturnReply::
	.string "DONA ZILA: Good.\p"
	.string "Then walk in a way that lets\n"
	.string "you keep it.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_PromiseRecord::
	.string "Promise that you will record\n"
	.string "it all?$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_PromiseRecordReply::
	.string "DONA ZILA: Careful, my love.\p"
	.string "A full notebook is not the\n"
	.string "same as an understood one.\p"
	.string "But yes. Write.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_PromiseListen::
	.string "Promise that you will listen\n"
	.string "first?$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_PromiseListenReply::
	.string "DONA ZILA: Ah.\p"
	.string "That one is the hardest, and\n"
	.string "you picked it first.\p"
	.string "Go on, then.$"

AraunaPlayerHouse_Text_PromiseSilent::
	.string "DONA ZILA: No promise?\p"
	.string "That is allowed too.\n"
	.string "Come back when you have one.$"

@ Bond payoff - the First Link taken with Courage (canon 9.4).

AraunaMapLab_Text_CiroBondCourage::
	.string "CIRO: I heard what you did in\n"
	.string "that chamber.\p"
	.string "Tore the clamp off with your\n"
	.string "hands. Very you.\p"
	.string "Thing is, the readings went\n"
	.string "with it.\p"
	.string "Whatever that machine knew,\n"
	.string "nobody knows now.\p"
	.string "I'm not saying you were wrong.\n"
	.string "I'm saying it cost something.$"
